{"ticker":"HIG","updated":"2026-10-23T23:04:15Z","profile":{"longName":"The Hartford Insurance Group, Inc.","shortName":"The Hartford Insurance Group, I","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Insurance - Diversified","country":"United States","website":"https://www.thehartford.com","fullTimeEmployees":19200,"marketCap":37044453376,"trailingPE":9.678698,"forwardPE":9.921591,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.2636689,"pegRatio":0.12,"targetMeanPrice":146.85715,"targetHighPrice":163.0,"targetLowPrice":135.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":21,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.081,"earningsGrowth":0.361,"grossMargins":0.37868,"operatingMargins":0.17615,"profitMargins":0.1489,"totalRevenue":29315000320,"beta":0.493,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":146.07,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":120.33,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.72},"summary":"The Hartford Insurance Group, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, provides insurance and financial services to individual and business customers in the United States, the United Kingdom, and internationally. It operates through Business Insurance, Personal Insurance, Property & Casualty Other Operations, Employee Benefits and Hartford Funds. The company offers insurance coverage, including workers' compensation, property, automobile, general and professional liability, package business, umbrella, fidelity and surety, marine, livestock, accident, health, and reinsurance through regional offices, branches, sales and policyholder service centers, independent retail agents and brokers, wholesale agents, and reinsurance brokers. The company also provides automobiles, homeowners, and personal umbrella coverages. The Property & Casualty Other Operations segment offers coverage for asbestos and environmental exposures. In addition, it provides group life, disability, and other group coverages to members of employer groups, associations, and affinity groups through direct insurance policies; reinsurance to other insurance companies; employer paid and voluntary product coverages; disability underwriting, administration, and claims processing to self-funded employer plans; leave management solution; distributes its group insurance products and services through brokers, consultants, thir","summary_zh":"Hartford Insurance Group, Inc. 及其子公司為美國、英國和國際上的個人和企業客戶提供保險和金融服務。它透過商業保險、個人保險、財產和傷亡其他業務、員工福利和哈特福德基金進行運作。該公司透過區域辦事處、分支機構、銷售和投保人服務中心、獨立零售代理商和經紀人、批發代理商和再保險經紀人提供保險範圍，包括工人賠償、財產、汽車、一般和專業責任、包裹業務、雨傘、保真和保證、海事、牲畜、事故、健康和再保險。該公司還提供汽車、房主和個人雨傘保險。財產與傷亡其他業務部門提供石棉和環境暴露的保險。此外，它還透過直接保單向雇主團體、協會和親和團體的成員提供團體人壽、殘疾和其他團體保險；向其他保險公司再保險；雇主付費和自願產品保險；自籌資金雇主計劃的殘疾承保、管理和索賠處理；休假管理解決方案；透過經紀人、顧問等分銷其團體保險產品和服務","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"保險 - 多元化","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":133.55,"h":133.95,"l":132.63,"c":132.63,"v":1021700},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":132.16,"h":133.09,"l":132.12,"c":132.83,"v":1701300},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":132.74,"h":133.83,"l":132.74,"c":133.07,"v":1150200},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":132.84,"h":132.84,"l":131.88,"c":132.22,"v":1013800},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":132.58,"h":133.24,"l":131.93,"c":132.31,"v":1142800},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":131.9,"h":132.4,"l":130.81,"c":131.91,"v":1278200},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":131.67,"h":133.3,"l":131.39,"c":133.15,"v":1224500},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":134.05,"h":135.17,"l":133.69,"c":134.7,"v":1758800},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":134.81,"h":135.01,"l":130.75,"c":131.67,"v":1975100},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":131.07,"h":131.51,"l":129.67,"c":130.64,"v":1265200},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":130.14,"h":131.71,"l":130.03,"c":130.84,"v":1603000},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":130.19,"h":131.32,"l":129.48,"c":131.24,"v":1222000},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":131.56,"h":133.4,"l":131.28,"c":133.22,"v":1531300},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":132.62,"h":133.43,"l":132.12,"c":132.52,"v":1127400},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":132.59,"h":133.32,"l":131.44,"c":131.46,"v":1277200},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":131.65,"h":132.1,"l":129.57,"c":129.65,"v":2306400},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":129.88,"h":131.28,"l":129.88,"c":130.65,"v":1168600},{"t":"2025-09-18","o